        <activityName xml:lang="en">Inverter, Mont Soleil installation, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Inverter, Mont Soleil installation, at plant
Production of an inverter for a 560 kWp photovoltaic power plant in Switzerland.;
Synonyms: inverse rectifier; 
UUID: 2fd2afbe-7842-3234-a7aa-a40bdbf6d976
Materials, packaging and electricity use for the production of an inverse rectifier. Disposal of the product after use.
Location: Production in CH.
Technology: Inverter for a photovoltaic grid-connected system
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Detailed analysis of materials for one product 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2fd2afbe-7842-3234-a7aa-a40bdbf6d976.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
